    "note": [
        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "Yaqira, for flute, clarinet, violin, ‘cello and piano is in four\r\nmovements, each elaborating a seven note phrase from an\r\nAramaic supplication ending on the word 'Yaqira' (which means\r\n'precious'). The piece was inspired by an idea my daughter had of\r\nmusically representing the disorienting sense of kinetosis.\r\nYaqira was co-commissioned by the San Francisco\r\nbased ensemble, Earplay, and for the PluralEnsemble, (Madrid).",
